                "message": "⚡ Group the sp-fetch-inbox picker in one pass\n\n- arrange scanned all items once per folder: 5.3 s for 6000 items in 1500 folders, 11.5 s on Sia's inbox\n- Bucket by folder in a hash table; same for the folder counts of the C-u prompt\n- Test: 6000 items in 1500 folders arrange in under 1.5 s\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCXyk3bC6YPxjXfvkE",
